- [LEARN] REJECTED MISCONFIG @ api.signageos.io: /metrics /health /healthz /readyz all 404 — no Prometheus/health surface beyond /status.
- [LEARN] REJECTED MISCONFIG @ box.signageos.io: /metrics /health /config.json /graphql all 302→/login — /status and /login/ remain the only unauthenticated surfaces.

STEP 7 — RISK SCORE
- [RISK] box.signageos.io: 74 — Auth0 dashboard + the minting origin for the long-lived clientId/secret that gate api device-write endpoints; broad CSP trust boundary (20+ origins) and accepted /status info disclosure keep exposure material; no new unauth surface.
- [RISK] api.signageos.io: 85 — dual-auth API now confirmed (JWT + client-secret), org-context carried in a client-supplied query param (IDOR-shaped), device-write surface gated by a lower-class credential, token-mint endpoints, and a partially-migrated v2 surface; risk raised from 78.
